    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Measurement boundaries",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 56,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Job thresholds are local provisional diagnostics, not calibrated production SLOs. Pending can include healthy long-running jobs; check active work and delivery progress. Upstream idle/crash recovery remains a known deferred limit. Index bytes/document count, owner takeovers, oldest broker pending age and overload rejection are not currently exported; no fake 0 values are substituted."
      }
    }
